# Phase 8 baseline manifest
# Deterministic file list (LC_ALL=C path-sorted) with SHA-256 hashes over the committed Git blob content (not the
# Windows checkout bytes), covering the complete Phase 8 implementation baseline set: the validation production sources
# (anticheat-simulation: MovementValidation, MovementValidationRequest, MovementValidationResult, MovementValidator - the only
# producer of VALID / UNCERTAIN / INVALID - and the additive Phase 6 diagnostics in InputDomain, InputReconstructor and
# ReconstructionResult; anticheat-player: ContextEvent, MovementContextLedger; anticheat-core: MovementValidationRunner,
# ContextObservationMapper, ValidationStatus, ValidationEngineStatus and the PacketEngine composition; anticheat-platform-paper:
# the /papea2ac validate command, the status line and the live-INVALID log sink), which include the P8-F1, P8-F3, P8-F4, P8-F6
# forward fixes, the P8-F2 CLIMBABLE_CONTACT gate and the P8-F7 safeguard; tests (validator, corpus, property/metamorphic,
# fixtures + fixture harness, runner, engine integration, context ledger, live reproductions, the pre-baseline safety suite,
# the Phase 7 generator refactors and the ArchitectureTest Phase 8 boundary), ValidationBenchmarks, the memory harness,
# Gradle task changes, the Phase 8 report, the human approval record, and the artifacts (validation fixtures, legitimate /
# false-positive / native / timing corpus results, detection and invalid corpus results, benchmarks (final-code run),
# memory results, verification.json with the pre-baseline decisions, and the real-client evidence log).
# The frozen Phase 0-7 documents and docs/phase1..7-artifacts are intentionally NOT part of this manifest: the Phase 6/7
# code touched by Phase 8 is a forward addition; the historical baselines and their artifacts are unchanged.
